<title>SPAIN: MOTORCYCLING-CHECA WINS CATALONIAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-CHECA WINS CATALONIAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>MONTMELO, Spain 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carlos Checa of Spain, riding a Honda, won the Catalonian Grand Prix 500cc event on Sunday.</p>
<p>Australian Michael Doohan on a Honda came second and Alex Criville of Spain, also on a Honda, finished third.</p>
